{"id":"costela","lemma":"costela","pos":"noun","rank":3395,"glosses":["rib","rib (part of a ship’s framework)"],"ipa":"/kuʃˈtɛ.lɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"costelas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-costela.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nosso vizinho quebrou uma costela.","en":"Our neighbor has broken a rib.","words":[{"g":"ours being addressed)"},{"g":"neighbouring"},{"g":"to break","l":"quebrar"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Tom caiu do telhado e quebrou três costelas.","en":"Tom fell off the roof and broke three ribs.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to fall","l":"cair"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"roof"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to break","l":"quebrar"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Eu acho que estou com uma costela quebrada.","en":"I think I have a broken rib.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to find","l":"achar"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,{"g":"in separate pieces","l":"quebrado"}]},{"text":"Tom cutucou Mary nas costelas.","en":"Tom poked Mary in the ribs.","words":[{"g":"tone"},null,null,null,null]}]}